      "message": "If you make this a lambda, you don\u0027t need to pass these in.\n\nIf you want to avoid duplicating the code, you can do something like\n\n```\nauto test \u003d [](const std::string\u0026 name, SkPoint pt, SkColor expected) {\n   InspectPixelColorAtPoint(reporter, pixmap, name, pt, expected);\n};\n\ntest(\"left of top corner\", {4.0, 5.0}, SK_ColorWHITE);\n...\n```",
