      "writtenOn": "2026-03-17T17:05:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I changed the very specific color assertions to an assert color (or assert not color) so that we can check whether a pixel has anything drawn (i.e. not white) or if it\u0027s pure black as expected\n\nI kept the number of assertions the same, but let me know if you still think it should be reduced.",
